    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69903" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτῐλ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sailing, seamanship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.253
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				618
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				527d
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>voyage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.14
			</span></i>: and in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτιλίῃσι μακρῇσι ἐπιθέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				163
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτιλίῃσι χρέεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.43
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				3.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ship,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύσκαλμος ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.295.4
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>).</div>
